#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/96/
msgid "Aberrations - APM Deity"
msgstr "畸变怪 - 手速神明"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/96/
msgid "Go infinite with pirates, with [[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] and [[Proud Privateer||122520]] as core. [[Enterprising Escapee||132762]] and [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] help you spend gold at first to start snowballing economy. Then, your scaling is [[The Shadow of Doubt||131716]] to scale your deity. Once infinite, buy every [[Greedy Conniver||134421]] and golden them using [[Eyes of the Earth Mother||100601]] or [[Elite Navigator||119986]] in order to discover [[Sha of Fear||131720]]. Make sure to always end of 3 abberations."
msgstr "以 [[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] 和 [[Proud Privateer||122520]] 为核心，利用海盗实现无限循环。[[Enterprising Escapee||132762]] 和 [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] 能帮助你在前期消耗铸币，让经济开始滚雪球。然后，使用 [[The Shadow of Doubt||131716]] 强化你的神明。实现无限循环后，购买遇到的每一张 [[Greedy Conniver||134421]]，并使用 [[Eyes of the Earth Mother||100601]] 或 [[Elite Navigator||119986]] 将其变为金色，以便发现 [[Sha of Fear||131720]]。确保每回合结束时场上始终有3个畸变怪。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/96/
msgid "[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] + [[Proud Privateer||122520]] + [[The Shadow of Doubt||131716]]"
msgstr "[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] + [[Proud Privateer||122520]] + [[The Shadow of Doubt||131716]]"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/96/
msgid "[[The Shadow of Doubt||131716]]\n"
"[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]]"
msgstr "[[The Shadow of Doubt||131716]]\n"
"[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/96/
msgid "Play cards to scale deity."
msgstr "打出卡牌来强化你的神明。"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/89/
msgid "Pirates - APM Golden"
msgstr "海盗 - 金色手速"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/89/
msgid "Go infinite with [[Enterprising Escapee||132762]] + [[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] + [[Proud Privateer||122520]] setup, [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] helps to get the ball rolling. With the escapee, you'll play a lot of goldens and discovers, both of which helps with [[Hooktusk, Master Marauder||132925]]. Scale by being infinite and buying discover effects.  ADVANCED PLAYERS: Pivot higher cap which is demons shop buff comp"
msgstr "利用 [[Enterprising Escapee||132762]]、[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] 和 [[Proud Privateer||122520]] 的组合实现无限经济，[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] 可以帮助这套体系顺利启动。有了上进的逃兵后，你会打出大量金色随从并触发许多发现效果，这两者都能很好地配合 [[Hooktusk, Master Marauder||132925]]。利用无限经济购买带有发现效果的卡牌，不断提升阵容强度。进阶玩家：转型为上限更高的恶魔酒馆强化流。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/89/
msgid "[[Enterprising Escapee||132762]] + Infinite gold"
msgstr "[[Enterprising Escapee||132762]] + 无限铸币"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/89/
msgid "[[Enterprising Escapee||132762]]"
msgstr "[[Enterprising Escapee||132762]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/89/
msgid "Use infinite money to scale pirates"
msgstr "使用无限铸币来提升海盗属性"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/99/
msgid "Mechs - APM Magnetic"
msgstr "机械 - 手速磁力"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/99/
msgid "First, have infinite gold. [[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]], [[Proud Privateer||122520]], [[Enterprising Escapee||132762]], and [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] are all cards to get you infinite gold, and cycle every cheap card ([[Sellemental||64038]]). Then, start generating magnetics with [[Auto Reveille||134417]]. Scale a [[Spark Snapper||132676]] so every magnetic you attach gets big very fast. After you have [[Spark Snapper||132676]], leave a golden [[Drone Duplicator||132312]] on board, and start making a huge volumizer by attaching onto it. Triple it easily with Auto Reveille and then magnetize the huge magnetic you tripled onto the activated Drone Duplicator. Finally, buy every [[Greedy Conniver||134421]] and use Eyes of the Earth Mother on it to get [[Polarizing Beatboxer||98713]]."
msgstr "首先要建立近乎无限的金币循环。[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]]、[[Proud Privateer||122520]]、[[Enterprising Escapee||132762]]和[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]都能帮助你做到这一点。建立循环后，反复买卖[[Sellemental||64038]]等低费用随从。\n"
"接着用[[Auto Reveille||134417]]生成磁力随从，并提升[[Spark Snapper||132676]]的属性，让之后吸附的磁力随从迅速变强。拿到[[Spark Snapper||132676]]后，在场上留一个金色[[Drone Duplicator||132312]]，不断向它吸附磁力随从，养出一个属性极高的磁力随从。用[[Auto Reveille||134417]]将其轻松合成金色，再把这个巨大的金色磁力随从吸附到已触发效果的[[Drone Duplicator||132312]]上。\n"
"最后，买下所有遇到的[[Greedy Conniver||134421]]，并对它们使用大地母亲之眼，以获得[[Polarizing Beatboxer||98713]]。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/99/
msgid "Infinite gold ([[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] + [[Proud Privateer||122520]]) + [[Auto Reveille||134417]]"
msgstr "无限铸币 ([[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] + [[Proud Privateer||122520]]) + [[Auto Reveille||134417]]"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/99/
msgid "Infinite gold ([[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]])"
msgstr "无限铸币 ([[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]])"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/99/
msgid "Attach bigger and bigger magnetics"
msgstr "不断磁力吸附属性更高的随从"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/76/
msgid "Quilboar - APM Shop Buff"
msgstr "野猪人 - 手速商店强化"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/76/
msgid "You must have an insane amount of economy to go for this comp. This is usually achieved with a turn 9 Brann + Rogers + Privateer. You may also buff the shop cycling bloom gem buffers, spell power buffers, and buying every gem barrage card such as [[Veteran Brigand||132929]]. You'll also generate a ton of spells by being infinite, allowing [[Felboar||110664]] or [[Twisted Wrathguard||130662]] to eat a huge shop over and over again. The best cards to cycle are blood gem generators such as [[Fearless Foodie||113154]]. Casting targetted spells onto [[Gatekeeper Amalgam||133329]] or [[Devilish Distractor||132901]] is a good use of spells."
msgstr "要玩此流派，你必须拥有极强的经济能力。通常可以在第 9 回合靠 铜须+ 罗杰斯+ 私掠者 建立经济优势。你也可以通过反复买卖能强化宝石和提高法术强度的随从来提升酒馆中的随从，并购买[[Veteran Brigand||132929]]等所有能大量提供宝石的卡牌。经济运转起来后，你还会获得大量法术，让[[Felboar||110664]]或[[Twisted Wrathguard||130662]]反复吞噬属性极高的酒馆随从。最适合反复买卖的是[[Fearless Foodie||113154]]等能生成鲜血宝石的随从。将指定目标的法术施放到[[Gatekeeper Amalgam||133329]]或[[Devilish Distractor||132901]]身上，也能有效利用这些法术。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/76/
msgid "Early infinite gold + Felboar"
msgstr "早期无限铸币 + 邪能野猪人"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/76/
msgid "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]"
msgstr "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/76/
msgid "Cast spells to consume buffed shop."
msgstr "施放法术法术吞噬酒馆。"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/3/
msgid "Undead - APM Undead"
msgstr "亡灵 - 手速"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/3/
msgid "[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] combined with [[Proud Privateer||122520]] gives you lots of gold to hit more of your setup.  Additional cards that help you become infinite include [[Enterprising Escapee||132762]] and [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]], but can be cut once you commit more undeads to your board. Cycle every single free card ([[Refreshing Anomaly||64042]]) so you stay infinite. After you're infinite, scale undead attack using bounties + [[Forsaken Weaver||126733]]. Run a reborn golden [[Handless Forsaken||95265]] to be strong. Also use [[Snazzy Phantom||133083]] and cycle every single destroy undead effect such as [[Maw Caster||121508]] and [[Disguised Graverobber||104610]] to destroy reborns and give snazzy permanent stats."
msgstr "[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] 与 [[Proud Privateer||122520]] 的组合可以提供大量铸币，帮助你找到更多阵容组件。其他可以帮助你实现无限循环的卡牌包括 [[Enterprising Escapee||132762]] 和 [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]，但当你确定在场上投入更多亡灵后，可以将它们替换掉。循环使用所有免费卡牌（[[Refreshing Anomaly||64042]]），以维持无限循环。实现无限循环后，利用悬赏令和 [[Forsaken Weaver||126733]] 提高亡灵的攻击力。使用一张金色且具有复生的 [[Handless Forsaken||95265]] 来保证阵容强度。此外，使用 [[Snazzy Phantom||133083]]，并循环使用 [[Maw Caster||121508]] 和 [[Disguised Graverobber||104610]] 等所有能够消灭亡灵的效果，消灭具有复生的亡灵，让时尚魅影永久获得属性。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/3/
msgid "Bounty Generation ([[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]]) + [[Proud Privateer||122520]] + [[Forsaken Weaver||126733]]"
msgstr "悬赏令生成器 ([[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]]) + [[Proud Privateer||122520]] + [[Forsaken Weaver||126733]]"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/3/
msgid "[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]]"
msgstr "[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/3/
msgid "Scale undead attack with infinite gold"
msgstr "利用无限经济提高亡灵的攻击力"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/14/
msgid "Undead - Attack Scaling"
msgstr "亡灵 - 攻击提升"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/14/
msgid "Scale the attack of your Undeads and summons with the Butchering spell from [[Drustfallen Butcher||120104]]. Butchering spell improves with spell scaling from [[Friendly Geist||120219]]. Your quality of summons come from [[Handless Forsaken||95265]]. [[Snazzy Phantom||133083]] provides a ton of attack and health to your right most unit in combat, but also during the shop phase. Start using Butchering spells on your reborn cards with [[Snazzy Phantom||133083]] on board to capture permanent stats. The best variation of this comp is to run [[Dead Bellringer||132322]] + [[Mummifier||108992]] to first reborn your entire board. Then, with a full hand of butchering and also Snazzy, use bellringer activate on the mummifier, then the bellringer will get reborn, and then butcher the bellringer, and repeat for all your butchering spells. This'll give you an insane amount of Snazzy procs."
msgstr "使用 [[Drustfallen Butcher||120104]] 生成的“宰割”法术，提高亡灵及其召唤物的攻击力。[[Friendly Geist||120219]] 提供的法术成长可以进一步强化“宰割”，而 [[Handless Forsaken||95265]] 则负责提供优质召唤物。[[Snazzy Phantom||133083]] 能在战斗阶段和酒馆阶段为最右边的随从提供大量攻击力和生命值。场上有 [[Snazzy Phantom||133083]] 时，开始对具有复生的随从使用“宰割”，从而获得永久属性。这套阵容最强的变体是使用 [[Dead Bellringer||132322]] 和 [[Mummifier||108992]]，先让整个场面都获得复生。随后，在手中存满“宰割”且场上拥有时尚魅影时，让丧钟死灵对木乃伊工匠发动效果。木乃伊工匠被消灭后，丧钟死灵会获得复生。接着对丧钟死灵使用“宰割，并用手中所有“宰割”重复这一过程，从而大量触发时尚魅影。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/14/
msgid "Attack Scaling ([[Drustfallen Butcher||120104]]) + summons ([[Handless Forsaken||95265]])"
msgstr "攻击成长 ([[Drustfallen Butcher||120104]]) + 亡灵召唤([[Handless Forsaken||95265]])"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/14/
msgid "[[Deathly Striker||115610]] \n"
"Undead midgame ([[Plaguerunner||126451]])"
msgstr "[[Deathly Striker||115610]] \n"
"亡灵中期过度 ([[Plaguerunner||126451]])"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/14/
msgid "Summon high attack Undeads"
msgstr "召唤高攻击力的亡灵"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/15/
msgid "Dragons - Battlecries"
msgstr "龙 - 战吼"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/15/
msgid "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + [[Kalecgos, Arcane Aspect||60630]] gives all of your dragons +4/4 every single battlecry you play. You want to trigger as many battlecries as possible. After you have your setup, cycle only PREMIUM battlecries, such as [[Tavern Tempest||64077]], [[Refreshing Anomaly||64042]], [[Shell Collector||80740]] or [[Draconic Warden||126860]]. If [[Kelp Keeper||132883]] is in the game, leave it on the board to proc a premium battlecry every turn, preferably [[Draconic Warden||126860]]. The highest cap is to find as many double attack spell every turn, and permanently double the attack of Heroic Broodmother every turn with the help of [[Persistent Poet||108463]]. Additionally, permanently attach divine shield to your dragons with [[Nadina, The Red||60629]]."
msgstr "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + [[Kalecgos, Arcane Aspect||60630]] 能让你的所有龙在你每使用一张战吼牌后获得+4/+4。你需要触发尽可能多的战吼。阵容成型后，只循环使用优质战吼牌，例如 [[Tavern Tempest||64077]]、[[Refreshing Anomaly||64042]]、[[Shell Collector||80740]] 或 [[Draconic Warden||126860]]。如果本局游戏中有 [[Kelp Keeper||132883]]，就将其留在场上，每回合触发一个优质战吼，最好是 [[Draconic Warden||126860]]。这套阵容的最高上限是每回合尽可能多地寻找使攻击力翻倍的法术，并借助 [[Persistent Poet||108463]]，每回合永久翻倍英勇的巢母的攻击力。此外，还可以使用 [[Nadina, The Red||60629]] 永久为你的龙附加圣盾。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/15/
msgid "[[Kalecgos, Arcane Aspect||60630]] + [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]"
msgstr "[[Kalecgos, Arcane Aspect||60630]] + [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/15/
msgid "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]\n"
"[[Bronze Timewalker||132955]]"
msgstr "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]\n"
"[[Bronze Timewalker||132955]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/15/
msgid "Cycle battlecries to scale dragons"
msgstr "循环使用战吼来强化龙的属性"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/38/
msgid "Beasts - Beetles"
msgstr "野兽 - 甲虫"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/38/
msgid "With early [[Ravaging Scorpid||132949]] or [[Turquoise Skitterer||119255]], start scaling the stats of beetles. [[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]] can help you generate pieces of the comp with the help of [[Snarky Shark||132804]]. Run as many [[Banana Slamma||98824]] as possible, as they double the attack of your beetles and helps deals with high HP boards."
msgstr "前期获得 [[Ravaging Scorpid||132949]] 或 [[Turquoise Skitterer||119255]] 后，开始提高甲虫的属性。[[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]] 可以配合 [[Snarky Shark||132804]]，帮助你生成阵容所需的组件。尽可能多地使用 [[Banana Slamma||98824]]，它们可以使甲虫的攻击力翻倍，帮助你应对高生命值阵容。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/38/
msgid "Early [[Ravaging Scorpid||132949]] or [[Turquoise Skitterer||119255]]"
msgstr "早期 [[Ravaging Scorpid||132949]] 或 [[Turquoise Skitterer||119255]]"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/38/
msgid "[[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]]"
msgstr "[[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/38/
msgid "Summon large beetles"
msgstr "召唤大甲虫"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/88/
msgid "Quilboar - Choose One"
msgstr "野猪人 - 抉择"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/88/
msgid "First, have gem scaling, most commonly through [[Gem rat||116434]] but could be with [[Sanguine Refiner||122566]]. [[Turbo Hogrider||116195]] is the payoff for your gem scaling. It helps to have some choose one generation through [[Gem Rat||116434]] or [[Bramble Tunneler||132632]]. If dragons are in, use [[Sky-hatch Runaway||132957]] to proc [[Bramble Tunneler||132632]] for very powerful choose one generation."
msgstr "首先要提升鲜血宝石的效果，最常见的方法是使用[[Gem rat||116434]]，也可以使用[[Sanguine Refiner||122566]]。[[Turbo Hogrider||116195]]是宝石成长后的核心收益点。最好通过[[Gem Rat||116434]]或[[Bramble Tunneler||132632]]获取一些“抉择”效果。如果本局有龙，可以用[[Sky-hatch Runaway||132957]]触发[[Bramble Tunneler||132632]]，大量获取“抉择”效果。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/88/
msgid "[[Gem rat||116434]]/[[Bramble Tunneler||132632]] + [[Turbo Hogrider||116195]]"
msgstr "[[Gem rat||116434]]/[[Bramble Tunneler||132632]] + [[Turbo Hogrider||116195]]"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/88/
msgid "gem scaling ([[Gem Rat||116434]])"
msgstr "宝石成长 ([[Gem Rat||116434]])"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/88/
msgid "Play Choose One cards to scale"
msgstr "打出抉择卡来成长"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/101/
msgid "Dragons - Copebringer"
msgstr "龙 - 希望信使"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/101/
msgid "Find an early [[Hopebringer||134411]] (latest turn 8) and start scaling its effect. Use [[Persistent Poet||108463]] to keep the stats given by Hopebringer. The best dragon to buff is [[Heroic Broodmother||134494]], who additionally scales the Hopebringer a bunch. [[Nadina the Red||60629]] gives permanent shield to your Hopebringer and also increases your Hopebringer scaling a bit. [[Crimson Vindicator||132953]] can be used for stabilization."
msgstr "尽早找到[[Hopebringer||134411]]（最晚第 8 回合），开始叠加其效果。用[[Persistent Poet||108463]]保留 Hopebringer 提供的属性。最值得强化的龙是[[Heroic Broodmother||134494]]，它还能大幅提升 Hopebringer 的成长效果。[[Nadina the Red||60629]]能为 Hopebringer 提供永久圣盾，并进一步提高其成长幅度。[[Crimson Vindicator||132953]] 则可以用来稳住局面。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/101/
msgid "Early [[Hopebringer||134411]] + shields"
msgstr "早期获得 [[Hopebringer||134411]] +圣盾"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/101/
msgid "Divine Shields ([[Bronze Warden||60558]])"
msgstr "圣盾([[Bronze Warden||60558]])"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/101/
msgid "Proc Divine Shields to scale"
msgstr "触发圣盾来成长"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/100/
msgid "Demons - Deathrattle/Shop Buff"
msgstr "恶魔 - 亡语/商店强化"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/100/
msgid "Commit to this comp with an early [[Sacrificial Wrathguard||134405]] (turn 6 latest). Activate it every turn. Use [[Titus Rivendare||97408]] to double its effect and scale the shop a lot. [[Imp-lusionist||132899]] + [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]] is the main payoff for this comp and can eat many shops. [[Soulkeeping Jailer||132306]] is a great demon to help you stabilize."
msgstr "尽早拿到[[Sacrificial Wrathguard||134405]]（最晚第 6 回合），再确定玩这个流派，并每回合触发其效果。用[[Titus Rivendare||97408]]使效果触发两次，大幅提升酒馆中随从的属性。[[Imp-lusionist||132899]]与[[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]]是这套阵容的核心收益点，能吞噬大量酒馆随从。[[Soulkeeping Jailer||132306]]也是帮助你稳住局面的优秀恶魔。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/100/
msgid "Early [[Sacrificial Wrathguard||134405]]"
msgstr "早期获得 [[Sacrificial Wrathguard||134405]]"

