msgid "Sacrificial Wrathguard"
msgstr "牺牲的愤怒卫士"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/100/
msgid "Scale and eat the shop with deathrattles."
msgstr "利用亡语提升随从属性，并吞噬酒馆中的随从。"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/94/
msgid "Aberrations - Deathrattle/Spells"
msgstr "畸变怪 - 亡语/法术"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/94/
msgid "A LOT BETTER WITH CHTUN AS DEITY! Scale your deity with [[Faceless Converter||132331]] + [[Titus Rivendare||97408]]. Generate spells to scale your Converter, best using [[Unwilling Slacker||131700]], but [[N'raqi Sapper||131704]], [[Nightmare Corroder||133102]], or the APM Bounty package works too. Then, proc the deathrattle as many times as possible, typically using [[Deathstrider||132808]]. Best strategy is to use a beast rally ([[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]]), cycle [[Snarky Shark||132804]] and [[Lurking Lionfish||132794]] to proc your deathrattle during shop phase."
msgstr "神明是克苏恩时强得多！使用 [[Faceless Converter||132331]] + [[Titus Rivendare||97408]] 强化你的神明。生成法术来强化无面转化者，最好的方式是使用 [[Unwilling Slacker||131700]]，不过 [[N'raqi Sapper||131704]]、[[Nightmare Corroder||133102]] 或手速悬赏令体系也可以。然后尽可能多次触发亡语，通常需要使用 [[Deathstrider||132808]]。最佳策略是使用野兽进击（[[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]]），并循环使用 [[Snarky Shark||132804]] 和 [[Lurking Lionfish||132794]]，在酒馆招募阶段触发你的亡语。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/94/
msgid "[[Faceless Converter||132331]] + [[Titus Rivendare||97408]]\n"
"[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] + [[Proud Privateer||122520]] pivot highest cap"
msgstr "[[Faceless Converter||132331]] + [[Titus Rivendare||97408]]\n"
"[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] + [[Proud Privateer||122520]] 阵容上限最高"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/94/
msgid "Spell generation ([[Unwilling Slacker||131700]])"
msgstr "法术生成 ([[Unwilling Slacker||131700]])"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/94/
msgid "Play spells and proc deathrattle to scale Deity"
msgstr "施放酒馆法术并触发亡语，让神明不断成长"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/63/
msgid "Quilboar - Gems from Hand"
msgstr "野猪人 - 手牌宝石"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/63/
msgid "First, you need Gem scaling ([[Sanguine Refiner||122566]]) to enable this build. Then, you scale by adding gems to your hand with mainly [[Victorious Geomant||134423]], and then casting them with [[Hot-Air Surveyor||113152]]. Cast them onto great utility units such as [[Blade Collector||99035]]. In the lategame, when you're done concentrating stats, fill the rest of your board with ending units such as [[Leeroy the Reckless||90425]]"
msgstr "首先，你需要用[[Sanguine Refiner||122566]]提升宝石效果，才能玩这个流派。之后主要依靠[[Victorious Geomant||134423]]将宝石加入手牌，再用[[Hot-Air Surveyor||113152]]施放宝石。优先将宝石用于[[Blade Collector||99035]]等功能性随从。到了后期，完成属性集中后，用[[Leeroy the Reckless||90425]]等终局随从填满剩余的场上位置"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/63/
msgid "Gem scaling ([[Sanguine Refiner||122566]]) + [[Hot Air Surveyor||113152]]"
msgstr "宝石成长 ([[Sanguine Refiner||122566]]) + [[Hot Air Surveyor||113152]]"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/63/
msgid "Gem scaling ([[Sanguine Refiner||122566]])"
msgstr "宝石成长 ([[Sanguine Refiner||122566]])"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/63/
msgid "Add buffed gems to hand"
msgstr "将增强过的宝石置入手牌"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/31/
msgid "Murlocs - Keyword"
msgstr "鱼人 - 关键词"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/31/
msgid "Use Sewer Escapee and start putting keywords on a premium murloc early. The best one is [[Expert Aviator||126637]], and the second best one is [[Bile Spitter||122219]]. Then, use [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] to cycle [[Primalfin Lookout||60028]] and Hackerfin. Even better if you can proc a premium battecry repeatedly with [[Kelp Keeper||132883]]. With [[Expert Aviator||126637]], you want to summon a million scam cards from hand such as [[Leeroy, The Reckless||90425]] and [[Deadly Spore||65031]]."
msgstr "尽早使用下水道逃生鱼人，给一只优质鱼人添加额外关键词。首选[[Expert Aviator||126637]]，其次是[[Bile Spitter||122219]]。然后用 [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] 循环使用[[Primalfin Lookout||60028]]和黑客鱼人。如果还能用[[Kelp Keeper||132883]]反复触发优质战吼，效果会更好。使用[[Expert Aviator||126637]]时，尽量从手牌中大量召唤[[Leeroy, The Reckless||90425]]和[[Deadly Spore||65031]]等针对型随从。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/31/
msgid "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + Sewer Escapee"
msgstr "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + 下水道逃生鱼人"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/31/
msgid "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]\n"
"Sewer Escapee"
msgstr "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]\n"
"下水道逃生鱼人"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/31/
msgid "Add Keywords to Murlocs and buff them"
msgstr "为鱼人赋予额外关键词，并强化它们"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid "Beasts - Leviathan"
msgstr "野兽 - 深潜巨兽"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid "Summon as many beasts as possible after you get early [[Lurking Leviathan||130711]]. The best beast summoner is reborned [[Sewer lord||130996]]. Hoarding Hyena summons a taunt summon which is the next best. Then, paired with [[Banana Slamma||98824]], every summon will have a ton of attack."
msgstr "尽早获得 [[Lurking Leviathan||130711]] 后，尽可能多地召唤野兽。最好的野兽召唤组件是获得了复生的 [[Sewer lord||130996]]。其次是囤食土狼，它可以召唤一个具有嘲讽的随从。搭配 [[Banana Slamma||98824]] 后，每个召唤出来的随从都能获得大量攻击力。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid "Early [[Lurking Leviathan||130711]] + Beast summons ([[Sewer Lord||130996]])"
msgstr "早期获得[[Lurking Leviathan||130711]] + 野兽召唤([[Sewer Lord||130996]])"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid "Beast summons midgame (beetles)"
msgstr "野兽召唤中期过度（甲虫）"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid "Make huge attack summons"
msgstr "做出巨大的召唤物"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/95/
msgid "Elementals - Living Azerite"
msgstr "元素 - 活化艾泽里特"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/95/
msgid "Use [[Living Azerite||107939]] to scale the shop. May use [[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] + [[Proud Privateer||122520]] to cast a bunch of spells. Then, your payoff for the shop buff is generating as many Arcane Absorption as possible, which is the spell from [[Leyline Surfacer||130294]].  Use [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] and [[Kelp Keeper||132883]] to generate them, and [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]] to doubt its effect. Finally, the best elemental to buff is [[Wildfire Elemental||64189]]."
msgstr "使用 [[Living Azerite||107939]] 强化酒馆。你可以利用 [[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] + [[Proud Privateer||122520]] 施放大量法术。然后，酒馆强化的核心收益手段是生成尽可能多的奥术吸收，也就是 [[Leyline Surfacer||130294]] 生成的法术。使用 [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] 和 [[Kelp Keeper||132883]] 生成奥术吸收，再用 [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]] 使其效果翻倍。最后，最适合接受强化的元素是 [[Wildfire Elemental||64189]]。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/95/
msgid "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + [[Living Azerite||107939]] + good economy"
msgstr "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + [[Living Azerite||107939]] + 良好经济"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/95/
msgid "Buff Elementals in shop"
msgstr "强化酒馆中的元素"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/56/
msgid "Murlocs - Magicfin"
msgstr "鱼人 - 小学生"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/56/
msgid "This comp relies on teaching a great spell to Magicfin Apprentice and proccing it over and over again. [[Young Murk-eye||87084]] is a must to proc these spells every turn, with its effect amplified by [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] and [[Drakkari Enchanter||101314]]. Teach the apprentice [[Shiny ring||109230]], [[Azerite Empowerment||109232]], or [[Time management||117573]] with some spell scaling, which comes from [[Felfire Conjurer||120299]]. Early on, it may be nice to teach it some econ spell as well, notable [[Strike Oil||104029]], or proc [[Refreshing Anomaly||64042]]."
msgstr "这个流派依赖于教会魔鳍学徒一个强大的法术并不断触发它。[[Young Murk-eye||87084]] 是每回合触发这些法术的必备卡，其效果被 [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] 和 [[Drakkari Enchanter||101314]] 增强。教会学徒 [[Shiny ring||109230]]、[[Azerite Empowerment||109232]] 或 [[Time management||117573]]，并搭配一些法强，这些法强来自 [[Felfire Conjurer||120299]]。在早期，教它一些经济法术也不错，特别是[[Strike Oil||104029]]，或者触发[[Refreshing Anomaly||64042]]。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/56/
msgid "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + [[Magicfin Mycologist||122277]] + [[Young Murk-eye||87084]]"
msgstr "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + [[Magicfin Mycologist||122277]] + [[Young Murk-eye||87084]]"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/56/
msgid "[[Magicfin Mycologist||122277]]\n"
"[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]"
msgstr "[[Magicfin Mycologist||122277]]\n"
"[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/56/
msgid "Teach Murlocs spells and proc them"
msgstr "教会鱼人法术并触发它们"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/91/
msgid "Mechs - Magnetics/Spells"
msgstr "机械 - 磁力/法术"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/91/
msgid "Put targetted spells on mechs as much as possible with [[Glambot||132893]] on board. [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]] doubles the effect. Cycle good gem cards such as [[Fearless Foodie||113154]] and buy good spells such as 3 pointy arrow spell. Eventually, buy [[Utility Drone||98588]] to capitalize on the magnetics you attached with Glambot in the midgame."
msgstr "场上有 [[Glambot||132893]] 时，尽可能多地对机械使用定向法术。[[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]] 可以使这些法术的效果触发两次。反复使用 [[Fearless Foodie||113154]] 等优质鲜血宝石卡牌，并购买“武器锻造”等优质法术来获取3张尖利箭矢。最后购买 [[Utility Drone||98588]]，利用中期通过微光机器人磁力吸附的大量组件获得进一步成长。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/91/
msgid "[[Glambot||132893]] + [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]]"
msgstr "[[Glambot||132893]] + [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]]"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/91/
msgid "[[Glambot||132893]] to stabilize"
msgstr "用 [[Glambot||132893]] 稳定下来"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/91/
msgid "Cast spells on Mechs"
msgstr "对机械施放法术"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/98/
msgid "Menagerie"
msgstr "喝茶流"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/98/
msgid "Play spells onto [[Gatekeeper Amalgam||133329]] to buff one minion of each type. [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]] doubles your scaling, and [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] increases spell generation and overall economy. Additionally, spell power units such as ([[Dark Puppeteer||131706]]) are nice to run in this comp. Economy units such as [[Enterprising Escapee||132762]] or [[Magicfin Mycologist||122277]] gives more gold to hit more core cards and targetted spells. Finally, [[Hot-air Surveyor||113152]] and/or [[Victorious Geomant||134423]] increase the total spells played on your Amalgam. If Deity is Y'sharajj, then running reborn amalgam is very strong because Y'sharajj will resummon it."
msgstr "对 [[Gatekeeper Amalgam||133329]] 施放法术，使每个随从类型各有一个随从获得强化。[[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]] 能让你的成长效果翻倍，[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] 则能提高法术生成能力和整体经济。此外，这个流派也适合使用法术强度随从，例如 ([[Dark Puppeteer||131706]])。[[Enterprising Escapee||132762]] 或 [[Magicfin Mycologist||122277]] 等经济组件能提供更多铸币，帮助你找到更多核心卡牌和指向性法术。最后，[[Hot-air Surveyor||113152]] 和/或 [[Victorious Geomant||134423]] 能增加你对守门融合怪施放的法术总数。如果你的神明是亚煞极，使用带有复生的守门融合怪会非常强，因为亚煞极可以将其重新召唤。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/98/
msgid "[[Gatekeeper Amalgam||133329]] + [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]] or spell power ([[Dark Puppeteer||131706]])"
msgstr "[[Gatekeeper Amalgam||133329]] + [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]] 或法强 ([[Dark Puppeteer||131706]])"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/98/
msgid "Spell power ([[Dark Puppeteer||131706]])\n"
"[[Gatekeeper Amalgam||133329]]"
msgstr "法强 ([[Dark Puppeteer||131706]])\n"
"[[Gatekeeper Amalgam||133329]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/98/
msgid "Cast targetted spells to scale all tribes"
msgstr "施放指向性法术强化所有随从类型"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/13/
msgid "Demons - Self Damage"
msgstr "恶魔 - 自伤"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/13/
msgid "The idea of this comp is to use effects such as [[Malchezaar, Prince of Dance||99199]], [[Wrath Weaver||59670]], or trinkets to deal damage to your hero, and [[Ashen Corruptor||121687]] to negate this damage. [[Tichondrius||99228]] is some payoff for self damage, and used to stabilize in the midgame. Cupcakes generation with [[Eredar Escapist||133028]] is your main payoff for the lategame, targetting [[Ashen Corruptor||121687]] to buff your shop. [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]] doubles the effect of both Cupcakes and [[Devilish Distractor||132901]]. With [[Wrath Weaver||59670]], every single Demon played makes your next spell free which generates a ton of value. The best demon generation is from [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] and cycling [[Imposing Percussionist||99232]]."
msgstr "这个流派的思路是利用 [[Malchezaar, Prince of Dance||99199]]、[[Wrath Weaver||59670]] 或饰品等效果对自己的英雄造成伤害，再通过 [[Ashen Corruptor||121687]] 回溯这些伤害。[[Tichondrius||99228]] 能从自残中获得收益，并帮助你在中期稳住场面。[[Eredar Escapist||133028]] 生成的腐化糕点是后期的主要收益手段，将腐化糕点用于 [[Ashen Corruptor||121687]] 来强化酒馆。[[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]] 可以使腐化糕点和 [[Devilish Distractor||132901]] 的效果触发两次。拥有 [[Wrath Weaver||59670]] 后，每使用一张恶魔牌都会使你的下一张法术牌变为免费，从而创造大量价值。最好的恶魔生成方式是使用 [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]，并循环使用 [[Imposing Percussionist||99232]]。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/13/
msgid "[[Ashen Corruptor||121687]] + self damage ([[Wrath Weaver||59670]] or [[Malchezaar, Prince of Dance||99199]]) + payoff ([[Tichondrius||99228]] or [[Eredar Escapist||133028]])"
msgstr "[[Ashen Corruptor||121687]] + 自伤效果（[[Wrath Weaver||59670]] 或 [[Malchezaar, Prince of Dance||99199]]）+ 核心收益组件（[[Tichondrius||99228]] 或 [[Eredar Escapist||133028]]）"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/13/
msgid "[[Wrath Weaver||59670]] + [[Soul Rewinder||100949]] demon midgame"
msgstr "[[Wrath Weaver||59670]] + [[Soul Rewinder||100949]] 恶魔中期过度"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/13/
msgid "Use self-damage to scale"
msgstr "利用自伤提升属性"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/41/
msgid "Demons - Shop Buff"
msgstr "恶魔 - 商店强化"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/41/
msgid "Scale your shop with [[Devilish Distractor||132901]], best when paired with [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]]. Then, your payoff for the buffed shop is most commonly [[Felboar||110664]], but it could also be [[Twisted Wrathguard||130662]] and/or reborn [[Imp-lusionist||132899]]. Use [[Methodical Madness||132903]] spells on shops with Divine shield or Venomous to give these keywords to all your demons."
msgstr "使用 [[Devilish Distractor||132901]] 强化酒馆，最好搭配 [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]]，让强化效果触发两次。酒馆获得大量强化后，最常见的收益组件是 [[Felboar||110664]]，也可以使用 [[Twisted Wrathguard||130662]]，或者获得了复生的 [[Imp-lusionist||132899]]。对酒馆中具有圣盾或剧毒的随从使用 [[Methodical Madness||132903]] 生成的法术，让你的所有恶魔获得这些关键词。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/41/
msgid "Buffed Shop ([[Devilish Distractor||132901]]) + [[Twisted Wrathguard||130662]]"
msgstr "强化的商店([[Devilish Distractor||132901]]) + [[Twisted Wrathguard||130662]]"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/41/
msgid "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]\n"
"[[Twisted Wrathguard||130662]]"
msgstr "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]\n"
"[[Twisted Wrathguard||130662]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/41/
msgid "Scale and consume shop"
msgstr "强化并吞噬商店"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/97/
msgid "Aberrations - Sludge"
msgstr "畸变怪 - 腐泥"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/97/
msgid "*BEST With Y'sharjj as Deity* Use [[Nightmare Corroder||133102]] +[[Drakkari Enchanter||101314]] to generatesludges. Use [[N'raqi Frostcaller||132136]] or [[Felfire Conjurer||120299]] or [[Dark Puppeteer||131706]] to scale spell power, which improves your sludges. Finally, use [[Mysterious K'thir||134497]] and Frostcaller to discard the sludges you generate. Comp significantly improved by Sludge Portrait greater trinket, and also if your deity is Ysharjj."
msgstr "*以亚煞极为神祇时效果最佳* 使用[[Nightmare Corroder||133102]]和[[Drakkari Enchanter||101314]]生成腐泥侵蚀。用[[N'raqi Frostcaller||132136]]、[[Felfire Conjurer||120299]]或[[Dark Puppeteer||131706]]提高法术强度，让腐泥侵蚀更强。最后，用[[Mysterious K'thir||134497]]和[[N'raqi Frostcaller||132136]]弃掉生成的腐泥侵蚀。如果拿到大型饰品“腐泥肖像”，或神明是亚煞极时这个流派的强度会显著提高。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/97/
msgid "Spell generation ([[Nightmare Corroder||133102]], Sludge Portrait) + Spell Power ([[N'raqi Frostcaller||132136]])"
msgstr "法术生成 ([[Nightmare Corroder||133102]], 腐泥肖像) + 法强 ([[N'raqi Frostcaller||132136]])"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/97/
msgid "[[Nightmare Corroder||133102]] + discard midgame"
msgstr "[[Nightmare Corroder||133102]] + 弃牌中期过渡"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/97/
msgid "Discard sludges to scale"
msgstr "弃掉腐泥侵蚀来强化"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/12/
msgid "Beasts - Summons"
msgstr "野兽 - 召唤"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/12/
msgid "First, have [[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]] in the midgame to start generating many beasts and along the way, generate the core pieces to this comp. Then, proc [[Goldrinn, the Great Wolf||59955]] during shop phase with the help of [[Deathstrider||132808]]. [[Titus Rivendare||97408]] also doubles the effectiveness of this strategy. Force your Gryphon to attack using [[Lurking Lionfish||132794]] activate or cycling [[Snarky Shark||132804]]. Best case is when you chain shop attacks by generating more Lionfish and Sharks. Then, use [[Sewer Lord||130996]] and [[Banana Slamma||98824]] to benefit from the aura from Goldrinn and summon huge attack beasts."
msgstr "首先，在中期拿到 [[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]]，开始生成大量野兽，并在此过程中集齐这个流派的核心组件。然后，借助 [[Deathstrider||132808]] 在酒馆招募阶段触发 [[Goldrinn, the Great Wolf||59955]]。[[Titus Rivendare||97408]] 还能使这套策略的效果翻倍。利用 [[Lurking Lionfish||132794]] 的发动效果或循环使用 [[Snarky Shark||132804]]，迫使猎头狮鹫攻击。最理想的情况是生成更多深潜狮子鱼和尖利的鲨鱼，让酒馆招募阶段的攻击连续触发。最后，使用 [[Sewer Lord||130996]] 和 [[Banana Slamma||98824]]，利用巨狼戈德林的光环效果召唤拥有巨额攻击力的野兽。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/12/
msgid "[[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]] + [[Deathstrider||132808]] + [[Goldrinn, the Great Wolf||59955]]"
msgstr "[[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]] + [[Deathstrider||132808]] + [[Goldrinn, the Great Wolf||59955]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/12/
msgid "Scale summoned beasts in combat"
msgstr "在战斗中召唤强化的野兽"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/87/
msgid "Beasts - Tasty Lobstah"
msgstr "野兽 - 美味龙虾"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/87/
msgid "Trigger [[Tasty Lobster||132796]] deathrattle as many times as possible. This is done with multiple rallies + [[Deathstrider||132808]] and [[Titus Rivendare||97408]], triggering Lobster deathrattle upon every rally. Trigger the lobster deathrattle during shop phase using golden [[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]] and buying every [[Snarky Shark||132804]] and [[Lurking Lionfish||132794]]. Reborn taunt your lobster, and then windfury your Gryphon with [[Sprightly Scarab||108909]]."
msgstr "尽可能多地触发 [[Tasty Lobster||132796]] 的亡语。通过多次触发进击，并配合 [[Deathstrider||132808]] 和 [[Titus Rivendare||97408]]，让每次进击都能触发美味龙虾的亡语。在酒馆阶段，使用金色 [[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]] 触发美味龙虾的亡语，并买下所有 [[Snarky Shark||132804]] 和 [[Lurking Lionfish||132794]]。让美味龙虾获得复生和嘲讽，再使用 [[Sprightly Scarab||108909]] 让猎头狮鹫获得风怒。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/87/
msgid "[[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]] + [[Deathstrider||132808]]"
msgstr "[[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]] + [[Deathstrider||132808]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/87/
msgid "Trigger Lobster Deathrattle to scale"
msgstr "触发龙虾亡语以成长"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/67/
msgid "Murlocs - Tidecaller"
msgstr "鱼人 - 萨满招潮者"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/67/
msgid "First, have a ton of economy, typically starting from golden [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] or Brann + [[Magicfin Mycologist||122277]], remembering premium economy spells such as Cloning Conch or Battlecry Discovery. Then, your payoff card for all that economy is [[Shamanic Tidecaller||133026]]. Paired with [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]], play as many spells on the tidecaller as possible, which could be bloodgems or [[Iron Groundskeeper||103666]] spells. Scale premium murlocs in hand such as [[Bile Spitter||122219]] and [[Expert Aviator||126637]] so you can summon them and also [[Choral Mrrrglr||98948]] can capture all of the stats of the murlocs in your hand."
msgstr "首先，你需要拥有大量经济资源，通常从金色 [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]，或铜须配合 [[Magicfin Mycologist||122277]] 开始。同时要留意克隆海螺或战吼发现等优质经济法术。接下来，利用这些经济资源取得核心收益的卡牌是 [[Shamanic Tidecaller||133026]]。配合 [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]]，尽可能对潮汐召唤者使用更多法术，例如鲜血宝石或 [[Iron Groundskeeper||103666]] 生成的法术。强化手牌中的优质鱼人，例如 [[Bile Spitter||122219]] 和 [[Expert Aviator||126637]]。这样既可以在战斗中召唤它们，也能让 [[Choral Mrrrglr||98948]] 获得你手牌中所有鱼人的属性值。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/67/
msgid "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + lots of economy + [[Shamanic Tidecaller||133026]]"
msgstr "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + 大量经济 + [[Shamanic Tidecaller|||133026]]"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/67/
msgid "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]\n"
"[[Shamanic Tidecaller||133026]]"
msgstr "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]\n"
"[[Shamanic Tidecaller|||133026]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/67/
msgid "Play spells to scale Murlocs."
msgstr "释放酒馆法术扩大鱼人的属性。"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/92/
msgid "Elementals - Unbound Tempest"
msgstr "元素 - 无羁雷暴"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/92/
msgid "Buff the shop with either [[Living Azerite||107939]] or [[Air Revenant||126173]], whichever method you find first. Use [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + [[Tavern Tempest||64077]] + [[Kelp Keeper||132883]] for massive economy and elemental generation. You may use [[Flaming Enforcer||126924]] to stabilize in the midgame, and [[Unbound Tempest||132983]] to cap out your scaling. With tempest, cycle premium elementals such as [[Sellemental||64038]] and [[Refreshing Anomaly||64042]]."
msgstr "使用 [[Living Azerite||107939]] 或 [[Air Revenant||126173]] 强化酒馆，优先采用最先找到的方式。利用 [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]、[[Tavern Tempest||64077]] 和 [[Kelp Keeper||132883]] 的组合获得大量经济并生成元素。中期可以使用 [[Flaming Enforcer||126924]] 稳住场面，后期则利用 [[Unbound Tempest||132983]] 将成长提升到最高上限。拥有无羁雷暴后，循环使用 [[Sellemental||64038]] 和 [[Refreshing Anomaly||64042]] 等优质元素。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/92/
msgid "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + shop buff ([[Air Revenant||126173]]) + [[Unbound Tempest||132983]]"
msgstr "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + 商店强化 ([[Air Revenant||126173]]) + [[Unbound Tempest||132983]]"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/92/
msgid "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]\n"
"[[Tavern Tempest||64077]] + [[Kelp Keeper||132883]]"
msgstr "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]\n"
"[[Tavern Tempest||64077]] + [[Kelp Keeper||132883]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/92/
msgid "Play elementals to scale from big shop"
msgstr "打出元素随从来强化商店"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/8/
msgid "Murlocs - Venom Scam"
msgstr "鱼人 - 下毒"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/8/
msgid "Buy all the scam cards and try to preserve placements by killing as many units as possible. Keep your strongest units on the board (that's why you want to concentrate stats!) and fill the rest of the board with units that may be able to trade 1 for 1. Aim to golden [[Expert Aviator||126637]] and give it venom using [[Bile Spitter||122219]]. Then, the Aviator will pull many scam units from your hand. Could give murlocs permanent Venom using [[Sky-hatch Runaway||132957]] as well."
msgstr "购买所有的下毒单卡，尽可能多杀一些随从以保住排名。保留你最强战力的卡牌（所以你才需要集中精力研究统计数据！），用可以各种能1换1的随从填充空余棋盘。目标是金色的[[Expert Aviator||126637]] 并通过 [[Bile Spitter||122219]] 给它上毒。然后飞行专家会把你手牌中的下毒卡拉到场上。也能用 [[Sky-hatch Runaway||132957]] 给鱼人永久施加烈毒。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/8/
msgid "When you have no future or are clearly getting outstatted"
msgstr "当你觉得没有未来或明显快被淘汰时"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/8/
msgid "Getting outscaled"
msgstr "快被淘汰了"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/8/
msgid "Buy scam cards and try to preserve placements"
msgstr "购买下毒卡牌，试图吃烂分"

